---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy for AI Magic Spells">
  <section class="info-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="info-meta">Last updated: 2026-07-30</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container info-prose">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>1. What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          Almost nothing. AI Magic Spells is a static site hosted on GitHub Pages with no
          backend database. We do not collect names, emails, or any personal information.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Cookies & local storage</h2>
        <p>
          We do not set tracking cookies. We may store a single localStorage value to remember
          your language preference (en/zh) across sessions. This is purely client-side and
          can be cleared at any time.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          We may use Google Analytics to count anonymous visits and Cloudflare for CDN
          protection. These services have their own privacy policies. We may display
          Google AdSense ads on content pages; those ads use Google's own cookies.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Embedded resources</h2>
        <p>
          All images are loaded directly from the original source CDN (img1.aiart.pics).
          When you view a prompt page, your browser requests these images from that CDN,
          which sees your IP address per its own privacy policy.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          If you want your prompt removed from the gallery, see our <a href="/contact">contact</a>.
          We will action valid takedown requests within 48 hours.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Children's privacy</h2>
        <p>
          This site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect
          information from children.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Updates</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this privacy policy at any time. Changes will be posted on this page.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .info-hero { padding: 80px 0 32px; text-align: center; }
  .info-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 44px);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .info-meta { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; margin: 0; }
  .info-prose { max-width: 760px; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 20px; margin: 28px 0 10px; font-weight: 700; }
  .prose p { color: var(--text-soft); line-height: 1.75; }
  .prose a { color: var(--accent-soft); }
</style>